    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_556237d95b0887ccd064",
      "document_start": 59,
      "document_end": 70,
      "text": "# 1）经典力学方法;",
      "section_id": "section_61f563dc8f4e"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_dacb5a107c4f0fb92541",
      "document_start": 71,
      "document_end": 103,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_61f563dc8f4e"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_0377eabea59b4cf4f620",
      "document_start": 105,
      "document_end": 146,
      "text": "经典力学是利用动量守恒定律研究碰撞问题的，因此，动量守恒定律是经典碰撞理论的基础。",
      "section_id": "section_61f563dc8f4e"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_fc5545dbe5a44591f0f6",
      "document_start": 146,
      "document_end": 208,
      "text": "该理论假设碰撞物体是完全刚性，碰撞持续时间为0，可以用来解决完全弹性碰撞和完全非弹性碰撞问题，但大多数碰撞是处于二者之间的。",
      "section_id": "section_61f563dc8f4e"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_3f74d188e1dcb48bb6c1",
      "document_start": 208,
      "document_end": 297,
      "text": "为此，牛顿引入恢复系数来研究碰撞过程中能量的损失及碰撞前后物体速度的变化，认为碰撞前后相对速度的比为常数，且该常数与碰撞物体的材料性质有关，与物体的形状、大小与碰撞前的速度无关。",
      "section_id": "section_61f563dc8f4e"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_5e4440e0c86f2c6326d7",
      "document_start": 299,
      "document_end": 319,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 2;",
      "section_id": "section_61f563dc8f4e"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_413d0d2522d582615d47",
      "document_start": 320,
      "document_end": 331,
      "text": "# 1）经典力学方法;",
      "section_id": "section_61f563dc8f4e"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_5900f4e3aa211d54729d",
      "document_start": 332,
      "document_end": 364,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_61f563dc8f4e"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_40763c74ec29b077fe0c",
      "document_start": 366,
      "document_end": 415,
      "text": "经典力学不能用来解决碰撞过程中碰撞力大小的变化规律，在不关心碰撞力变化的情况下这种方法还是有效的。",
      "section_id": "section_61f563dc8f4e"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_f7560cffa6888f4fde85",
      "document_start": 415,
      "document_end": 445,
      "text": "泊松模型方法是采用经典力学来解决碰撞问题常用的模型处理方法。",
      "section_id": "section_61f563dc8f4e"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_e3d4e597048df45d65cd",
      "document_start": 445,
      "document_end": 488,
      "text": "该方法认为，碰撞在瞬间完成，通过求解一系列线性代数方程确定碰撞前后系统广义速度的变化。",
      "section_id": "section_61f563dc8f4e"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_ae15c2671936a41a8503",
      "document_start": 488,
      "document_end": 527,
      "text": "在求解过程中，不用积分，计算效率高，但是碰撞力计算不够精确，容易出现较大偏差。",
      "section_id": "section_61f563dc8f4e"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_2010594fb712a52cad38",
      "document_start": 527,
      "document_end": 587,
      "text": "此外，恢复系数取值是否准确也是碰撞问题求解的关键，实际上，恢复系数不仅与碰撞体材料有关，还与两物体的运动和动力参数有关。",
      "section_id": "section_61f563dc8f4e"
    }
  ],
